Description: Querencia Desktop settings centre (alpha)
 Querencia Einstellungen is the control centre of Querencia Desktop, a
 classic desktop in the style of GNOME 2: desktop background and icons,
 display resolution and monitor layout (wlr-output-management, with a
 15-second revert), fonts, theme and default applications.
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
